tring", "description": "上报消息全文，自然语言"}}, "required": ["content"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"name": "get_message_from_voice_agent", "description": "一次性消费 Voice Agent 发来的全部消息，返回 all_messages_from_voice_agent:消息1;消息2 或 当前没有新消息。状态栏为 not empty 或任务消息主动要求查看时调用；状态栏为 empty 时不要主动调用。", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {}}}}]}
