, "description": "放下当前抓取的物块。返回只有三种：本身就没加起来物块 / 成功释放物块 / 释放物块失败，请用手直接拿出来物块。", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {}}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"name": "send_to_voice_agent", "description": "把进度/结果/求助消息上报给 Voice Agent，返回 发送成功。", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {"content": {"type": "string", "description": "上报消息全文，自然语言"}}, "required": ["content"]}}}, {"type": "function", "function": {"name": "get_message_from_voice_agent", "description": "一次性消费 Voice Agent 发来的全部消息，返回 all_messages_from_voice_agent:消息1;消息2 或 当前没有新消息。状态栏为 not empty 或任务消息主动要求查看时调用；状态栏为 empty 时不要主动调用。", "parameters": {"type": "object", "properties": {}}}}]}
